You can convert scored points into credits (every 10 points = 1 credit). Visit our shop to expend these credits and buy some new cars – police car, fire truck, taxi, tank, petrol tanker, etc. All these vehicles will help you to score more points, and using a petrol tanker you can make an incredible explosion and get unbelievable number of points! 

